# Keep the build context small and the image reproducible.
#
# third_party matters most: it holds a locally built libghostty for the host platform, and copying a
# macOS archive into a Linux image would either be ignored or, worse, picked up by the cgo directives
# and fail to link. The cgo image builds its own from source in a separate stage.
/third_party/
/bin/
mise.local.toml
.git/
